---
description: Tests
globs: apps/api/tests/**, packages/**/tests/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- Never skip, xfail, weaken, or delete a test to make it pass
- Tenancy tests run as the app role, never as postgres
- Test intent from the spec, not the current implementation
- Use fixed dates (injected clock) for anything time-based
- Generate unique codes per test run; fixed literals collide
- Put tests in the folder for their phase (phase0/, phase1/, ...)
